@startuml audio-timing
' Light render. The body is audio-timing.iuml, shared with
' audio-timing-dark.puml, which supplies the same variables in dark values.
!theme plain

!$c_pkt   = "#FFFFFF"
!$c_frame = "#C8E6C9"

' The waveform, the lane separators and the axis are drawn with one line colour
' that **no skinparam reaches**: there is no TimingLineColor, and ArrowColor does
' not apply. Left at the default the dark render draws black steps on a near
' black canvas, visible only where the highlight happens to sit behind them.
' The modern style API does reach it.
<style>
timingDiagram {
  LineColor #333333
}
</style>

!include audio-timing.iuml
@enduml
